HOW TO PERSONALIZE THIS SITE
=============================

This is now the "Champion" theme — a classy black/gold/burgundy
"championship night" look that blends both basketball AND boxing
(since he loves both), with a championship belt you unbuckle as
the special interactive moment instead of a candle or a ball.

It's 3 files:
- index.html  → the text/content
- style.css   → the colors/styling
- script.js   → the animations

1. ADD HIS NAME AND DATE
   Open index.html and replace:
   [His Name]        → his first name
   [Birthday Date]    → e.g. "June 27th, 2026"
   [His Full Name]    → for the footer
   [Write your message here...] → your personal note

2. ADD HIS PHOTOS (4 spots in the gallery)
   Each photo has a line like this in index.html:
     <div class="photo-img placeholder" data-label="Photo 1"></div>

   Replace it with:
     <div class="photo-img" style="background-image:url('YOUR_IMAGE_LINK_HERE')"></div>

   Easiest way to get an image link:
   - Upload the photo to https://imgbb.com (free, no account needed)
   - Copy the "direct link" it gives you
   - Paste it into the style="background-image:url('...')" part

3. PREVIEW
   Just double-click index.html and it opens in your browser.
   Once you're happy, you can upload all 3 files to something like
   Netlify Drop (netlify.com/drop) to get a shareable link.

That's it — same elegant feel as the one your boyfriend made you,
now with a championship-belt twist that covers both sports he loves. 🏆